       "Word meanings: 'foeticide' = killing of the foetus; 'monologue' = a speech by one person; 'autopsy' = examination of a dead body; 'formaldehyde' = a preservative chemical; 'refrain' = a repeated line; 'simile' = a comparison using 'like'; 'indifference' = lack of concern; 'guilt' = the feeling of having done wrong; 'haunting' = deeply moving; 'monsoon' = the rainy season; 'sulking' = gloomy; 'neon' = bright glowing।"
