       "Word meanings: 'conquest' = victory by force; 'decisive' = most important; 'absorbed' = took in; 'inflections' = word endings; 'standardized' = made uniform; 'accessible' = easy to get; 'authoritative' = reliable; 'dignity' = nobleness; 'influential' = having great effect; 'rapidly' = quickly; 'periods' = stages of time; 'evolved' = developed gradually।",
